==Fallarbor Town==
[[File:Fallarbor Town RS.png|thumb|Fallarbor Town]]

The small town of {{to|Fallarbor}} is located between Routes {{rtn|113|Hoenn}} and {{rtn|114|Hoenn}}, and features rich soil perfect for gardening. A third {{pkmn|Contest}} Hall, where Trainers compete in [[Rank (Contest)|Super Rank]] Contests, can be found here. The town is also home to a [[Move Reminder|Move Maniac]] and a researcher named [[Professor Cozmo]].

