===Meet Lanette===
Inside the Pokémon Center, you find the PC in use by a woman named [[Lanette]]. She upgraded the previous version of the [[Pokémon Storage System]], adding a user-friendly graphical interface, the ability to store over 400 Pokémon, and the ability to change the {{DL|Pokémon Storage System|wallpaper}} of each Box. As she leaves, she invites you to visit her at her home on {{rt|114|Hoenn}}.

===Move Maniac===
The northwest house belongs to the [[Move Reminder|Move Maniac]]. This man knows every move a Pokémon can learn as it grows and can teach forgotten moves to any Pokémon, for a price. He charges a single [[Heart Scale]] for each move relearned.

