===Fossil Maniac's house===
The [[Fossil Maniac]]'s house stands on the outskirts of [[Fallarbor Town]]. Head inside and talk to his younger brother, who kindly gives you {{TM|28|Dig}}. When used in a cave, this field move returns the user to the entrance. If you follow the tunnel at the back of the house, you will find the Fossil Maniac hard at work. He won't give up any [[Fossil]]s, but mentions that others may be uncovered by {{rt|111|Hoenn}}'s raging sandstorm.

===Lanette's house===
Go south across the bridge to reach [[Lanette]]'s house. Inside, you find the woman struggling to organize her clutter. She is happy that you stopped by, but embarrassed by the state of her home. If you promise to keep her messiness a secret, she gives you a {{DL|List of decorations in Generation III|Seedot Doll}}{{sup/3|R}}/{{DL|List of decorations in Generation III|Lotad Doll}}{{sup/3|S}} as thanks.

===A Berry A Day===
Speak to the boy outside Lanette's house to receive a single Berry every day. Possible varieties include [[Razz Berry]], [[Bluk Berry]], [[Nanab Berry]], [[Wepear Berry]], and [[Pinap Berry]], and are determined randomly.
