===1F (Front)===
====Cozmo's Folly====
Go west over the bridge to find two Grunts from [[Team Magma]]{{sup/3|R}}/[[Team Aqua]]{{sup/3|S}}, who have just stolen a [[Meteorite]] from [[Professor Cozmo]]. A moment later, the leader of the opposing team enters, flanked by two of his subordinates. The thieves don't seem to care much, and leave with the Meteorite bound for [[Mt. Chimney]]. The team leader introduces himself as [[Archie]]{{sup/3|R}}/[[Maxie]]{{sup/3|S}}, and tells you that his group intends to thwart the villainous team's plans at any cost, as they have committed many destructive acts in their bid to enlarge the landmass{{sup/3|R}}/sea{{sup/3|S}}. He and his attendants then leave in pursuit of the thieves.

Once the others leave, speak to [[Professor Cozmo]] to learn that the villainous team convinced him to guide them to [[Meteor Falls]] with the promise that they would excavate Meteorites, his topic of study, for him. He regrets his mistake, and wonders aloud what they could be planning at [[Mt. Chimney]].
{{-}}
